SUMMARY:Treasure Island: Opening Show at Fulton Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Pirates\, songs\, a quest unfolds!  \nThe story of a boy who has to find meaning in his life\, who has to grow up and become a man. It recounts the adventures of Jim Hawkins and his coming of age with the help of a motley crew of pirates and a quest that tests his spirit and his courage. Robin and Clark have created a colorful\, vibrant\, family show with unforgettable characters\, and plenty of dancing\, singing\, and action to delight every audience. \n\n\n\n\n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/__trashed-18/
LOCATION:Fulton Theatre: Eichmann Family Series\, 12 North Prince Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts & Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2025/08/Treasure-Island-Artwork-Reveal-4x5-1.avif
END:VEVENT
