SUMMARY:First Friday at Keel Salon
DESCRIPTION:First Fridays at Keel are back—chiller than ever.\n\nThe weather’s warming up\, the city’s alive\, and our doors are open.\nCome hang for porch vibes\, drinks\, and the community we love bringing together.\n\nFor May\, we’re hosting:\nKnotting Tides\nThe Sugar Studio\nClaire (tiny tattoos)\n\nmaybe a little more… we’ll see 😉\n\nAnd yes—build-your-own bouquet bar 💐\n\nStop in. Stay a while. \n            \n        \n                \n                \n    Learn More
