SUMMARY:Servant Stage Company’s A BROADWAY MELODY
DESCRIPTION:Step into the spotlight with A Broadway Melody! This spectacular revue celebrates 100 years of Broadway magic\, featuring unforgettable songs and showstoppers from the greatest musicals of all time. With a powerhouse cast of dynamic performers\, this intimate cabaret-style performance brings the best of the Great White Way up close and personal. From classic tunes to modern hits\, A Broadway Melody is a joyful\, high-energy tribute to the music\, memories\, and magic that have defined a century of Broadway! \n            \n        \n                \n                \n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/servant-stage-companys-a-broadway-melody-2/
LOCATION:Lancaster Alliance Church\, 210 Pitney Road\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17601
CATEGORIES:Arts & Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/02/ss26_broadwaymelody_color-square.png.webp
ORGANIZER;CN="Servant Stage Company":MAILTO:info@servantstage.org
END:VEVENT
