SUMMARY:Join us for the DrumBeatsArt Experience at PAVAA Gallery
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a vibrant afternoon of cultural exploration. We are opening our doors for our 10th season!\nFrom 12:30-4:00pm explore an exquisite collection of Afrocentric art on display and available for acquisition\, all while immersing yourself in a melodic musical atmosphere. Connect with our co-owners and featured artists: Gerri McCritty\, Marion CoCo Coleman\, and Tyrell Hoff. Discover the stories behind the canvases and the vision that has sustained PAVAA Gallery for over a decade.\nAt 4:30pm: The DrumBeatsArt Experience\nExperience an original creation by Gerri McCritty. This powerful performance by Marion CoCo Coleman\, Tyrell Hoff\, and Gerri McCritty blends rhythm\, movement\, and visual art into a singular\, unforgettable hour of creative expression. Join us for this event on the 1st Saturday of every month from May to November. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/join-us-for-the-drumbeatsart-experience-at-pavaa-gallery/
LOCATION:PAVAA Gallery\, 632 North Christian Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts & Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/04/DBA-w-Drumstick.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="PAVAA Gallery%2C LLC":MAILTO:pavaagallery@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
